  pen charger's; both kept (i2c_hub_1, PMIC-GPIO states, gpio169 state).

When the pin moves: bump scripts/fetch-perpetua.sh, replace the same-numbered
files in kernel/patches/ with these, re-check `kernel/config/*.fragment`
against the head's devices/iceland/kernel.config (it now enables
